    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "MM Ward are delighted to present No. 68 Lacken View, Naas, a wonderfully located three bedroom home set at the end in a quiet cul-de-sac within this mature and highly convenient estate.\n\nThis charming property offers bright, spacious accommodation throughout and briefly comprises of a welcoming entrance hallway, a light filled sitting room with wood burning stove, a spacious kitchen/dining room overlooking the rear garden & a large back hall/utility to the rear.\n\nThe kitchen is fully fitted with ample storage units and counter space, complete with tiled flooring & all white goods.\n\n\nUpstairs, the accommodation continues with three generously sized bedrooms.\nThe bedrooms are bright and airy throughout. A family bathroom fitted with a white sanitary suite completes the first floor accommodation.\n\nOne of the stand out features of this lovely home is the exceptional outdoor space. The south west facing garden is very large, enclosed with paved area, laid to lawn creating an ideal setting for family living and outdoor enjoyment.\n\nNo. 68 enjoys an unbeatable location within walking distance of Naas Hospital, primary and secondary schools, shops, restaurants and sporting facilities. Naas town centre is just a short stroll away, while the M7 motorway and Sallins/Naas Train Station are both easily accessible, making this an ideal choice for commuters.\n\nThis lovely home benefits from a quiet family friendly setting, excellent outdoor space and a highly convenient location close to every amenity. \n\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hall - 13'2\" (4.01m) x 5'9\" (1.75m)\nGas boiler, Enclosed storage\n\nLiving room - 11'4\" (3.45m) x 13'9\" (4.19m)\nWood burning stove\n\nKitchen/Dining room - 8'4\" (2.54m) x 17'8\" (5.38m)\nTiled floor, Fitted kitchen with new hob & oven, Extractor fan, New washing machine & Fridge freezer\n\nBack hall/ Utility - 10'9\" (3.28m) x 6'2\" (1.88m)\nTiled floor, Door to rear garden\n\nLanding\nHot press, Window, Attic access with stira\n\nBathroom - 5'5\" (1.65m) x 6'7\" (2.01m)\nFully tiled, Window, WC, WHB, Tub with Triton shower\n\nMaster bedroom - 11'4\" (3.45m) x 10'7\" (3.23m)\n\nBedroom 2 - 12'6\" (3.81m) x 9'7\" (2.92m)\n\nBedroom 3 - 9'1\" (2.77m) x 7'7\" (2.31m)\nBuilt in wardrobe\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
